{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101293","id":2266490674,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6HF-cy","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101293","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101293.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101293.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101293","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101293/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101293/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101293/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/512abc38b21cd25f61d1cf759c4574a9e6ad0138","number":101293,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Remove implicit conversions from `String`, `Char16String` and `CharString` to data pointers. ","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This is mostly a _sanity_ change to avoid accidental conversions leading to unexpected behavior.\r\n\r\nI have not tested how many callers are affected (e.g. `String s = char_string`).\r\nAll that are will experience a noticeable improvement of speed because `strlen` does not have to be called.\r\n\r\n## Notes on implicitness\r\n\r\nI have made conversions from `String`-likes to `StrRange` implicit to aid the transition. \r\nI thought long and hard about whether I want to 'contribute' another implicit conversion to the codebase, seeing as though they are already leading to quite a lot of problems.\r\n\r\nHowever, I think conversion _to_ StrRange is one of the rare cases where it actually is warranted:\r\n- The conversion does not lose metadata about the contents (pointer and length).\r\n- No data is allocated, and the conversion is trivial.\r\n\r\nThe only gotcha for this conversion is really that it may lead to ambiguous calls, and it may lead to unintentional loss of ownership. However, both are true about the `const char *` conversions, so it's an upgrade all around.\r\n\r\n## Behavior changes\r\nThere are a few behavior changes that may lead to problems (though they are unlikely to). If problems are experienced somewhere, it's likely the caller should have been more explicit from the start, and should be addressed to do so.\r\n\r\nEspecially, callers will change behavior when encountering a `\\0`: Instead of cutting the string short, they will add the character to the middle of the string. In terms of `UTF-32`, the _new_ behavior is correct. Still, if unexpected behavior is observed, it should be evaluated on a case-by-case basis - most likely, the previous behavior was incorrect other behavior should be adjusted to fit.\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_